From 64dc11bc10f3aa6c1ce322cab82dae5eee2ef1d3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pvsnarasimha <pvsnarasimha2003@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 17:23:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign From/To fields, fix duplicate search results, add
 RailYatri-style date picker

- StationField.js: bordered card layout with icon, focus glow, and a
  clear button instead of bare unstyled text (From/To fields were
  overflowing/cramped on the search form).
- TrainSearchScreen.js: add a swap button between From/To, and gate the
  results FlatList strictly on formCollapsed so search results can never
  render both under the still-open form and under the collapsed
  orange-header view at once.
- New DayPickerModal.js: RailYatri "Change Start Day" style radio-button
  dialog (Tomorrow/Today/Yesterday/2-4 days ago), computed off the real
  current date.
- LiveTrackingScreen.js: replace the plain DD-MM-YYYY text field with a
  pressable field that opens DayPickerModal.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MGKaCWBEc2rtTTsPnQDkYV
